Note on data/scan_p17-21.png

Those five files are page scans of Figures 2-6 of

  Charles R. Plott and Shyam Sunder, "Efficiency of Experimental Security Markets
  with Insider Information: An Application of Rational-Expectations Models",
  Journal of Political Economy 90(4), 1982, 663-698.

They are the copyright of the original publisher and are included here only as the
source input the digitization is run on, so that the recovered trades can be checked
against what was printed. The CC BY 4.0 grant above covers this package's own code,
tables and figures; it does not extend to those scans.
